<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CommitMate | 팀의 성장을 돕는 가장 확실한 방법</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #6366f1;
            --primary-soft: #eef2ff;
            --text-dark: #1e293b;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
            --bg: #ffffff;
            --section-bg: #f8fafc;
            --border: #e2e8f0;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg); color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.6; }
        a { text-decoration: none; transition: 0.2s; }

        /* [Common] Layout Container */
        .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }

        /* [Header] */
        header {
            height: 80px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; width: 100%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            z-index: 1000;
        }
        .header-inner {
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%;
        }
        .logo { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 30px; align-items: center; }
        .nav-links a { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dark); }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--primary); }
        .btn-login { padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); color: white !important; }

        /* [Hero Section] */
        .hero {
            padding: 180px 0 100px;
            text-align: center;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, #f5f7ff, #ffffff);
        }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -1px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .hero h1 span { color: var(--primary); }
        .hero p { font-size: 20px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .cta-group { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; }
        .btn-lg { padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; }

        /* [Feature Section] */
        .features { padding: 100px 0; background: var(--section-bg); }
        .section-title { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; }
        .section-title h2 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .section-title p { color: var(--text-muted); }

        .feature-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 30px; }
        .feature-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .feature-card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .icon { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .feature-card h3 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .feature-card p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 15px; }

        /* [Footer] */
        footer { padding: 80px 0 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); background: white; }
        .footer-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 60px; }
        .footer-brand h2 { color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .footer-brand p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; }
        .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 80px; }
        .footer-links h4 { margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 14px; }
        .footer-links ul { list-style: none; }
        .footer-links li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .footer-links a { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; }
        .copyright { text-align: center; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 13px; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; padding-top: 30px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div class="container header-inner">
        <a href="#" class="logo">🚀 CommitMate</a>
        <nav class="nav-links">
            <a href="#features">기능소개</a>
            <a href="#">커뮤니티</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn-login">로그인</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn-login btn-primary">지금 시작하기</a>
        </nav>
    </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>의지만으로는 부족한<br><span>꾸준함</span>, 벌금으로 완성하세요</h1>
        <p>팀원들과 함께 목표를 세우고, 미완수 시 벌금을 자동으로 정산합니다.<br>총무의 번거로움은 줄이고 팀의 생산성은 높이세요.</p>
        <div class="cta-group">
            <a href="#" class="btn-lg btn-primary">무료로 시작하기</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn-lg" style="background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text-dark);">서비스 둘러보기</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="features" class="features">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>더 효율적인 벌금 관리</h2>
            <p>총무와 팀원 모두가 만족하는 투명한 시스템을 제공합니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">💸</div>
                <h3>투명한 장부 관리</h3>
                <p>누가 얼마를 냈고, 얼마나 남았는지 팀원 모두가 실시간으로 확인할 수 있습니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">🤖</div>
                <h3>자동 수납 알림</h3>
                <p>미완수자가 발생하면 시스템이 자동으로 알림을 보내 입금을 독촉합니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">📈</div>
                <h3>성장 데이터 분석</h3>
                <p>우리 팀의 주간 성공률과 랭킹을 시각화된 그래프로 제공합니다.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="footer-inner">
            <div class="footer-brand">
                <h2>CommitMate</h2>
                <p>팀을 위한 가장 스마트한 벌금 관리 솔루션</p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-links">
                <div>
                    <h4>제품</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="#">기능 소개</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#">요금제</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h4>고객지원</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="#">이용약관</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#">개인정보처리방침</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="copyright">
            © 2026 CommitMate. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>